<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mdclass:Constant xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:mdclass="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/metadata/mdclass" uuid="41e8625d-b2ff-4251-bb9d-577e43861530">
  <producedTypes>
    <managerType typeId="bb06aee7-ef1f-4960-a105-2d97d4667d1b" valueTypeId="718824b7-70f1-4171-ba64-b7a04c4c5d68"/>
    <valueManagerType typeId="f8626654-dcfa-4347-b695-ed6d271b7dad" valueTypeId="d8038195-7af4-484d-9de2-a9385ade8e29"/>
    <valueKeyType typeId="7d8b9fe2-f290-5610-98a0-012732d91669" valueTypeId="76d8e85b-0293-52f5-9eaf-4022cf8cb4cb"/>
  </producedTypes>
  <name>UseWaybill</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Use waybills</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>استفاده از بارنامه‌ها</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Utilizzare le lettere di vettura</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Wykorzystać samochodowe listy przewozowe</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Использовать товарно-транспортные накладные</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Gönderi listelerini kullan</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sử dụng hóa đơn vận chuyển</value>
  </synonym>
  <type>
    <types>Boolean</types>
  </type>
  <useStandardCommands>true</useStandardCommands>
  <toolTip>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>To enable printing of waybills in the &quot;Customer invoice&quot; and &quot;Goods transfer&quot; documents.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <toolTip>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>برای فعال کردن چاپ بارنامه در اسناد &quot;فاکتور مشتری&quot; و &quot;انتقال کالا&quot;.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <toolTip>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Per abilitare la possibilità di stampare le lettere di vettura nei documenti &quot;Realizzazione di beni e servizi&quot; e &quot;Merci in movimento&quot;.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <toolTip>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Dla włączenia możliwości drukowania samochodowych listów przewozowych w dokumentach &quot;Sprzedaż towarów i usług&quot; oraz &quot;Przemieszczenie towarów&quot;.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <toolTip>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Для включения возможности печати товарно-транспортных накладных в документах &quot;Реализация товаров и услуг&quot; и &quot;Перемещение товаров&quot;.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <toolTip>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>&quot;Müşteri faturası&quot; ve &quot;Mal Transferi&quot; belgelerinde gönderi listesinin yazdırılması imkanını sağlamak için.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <toolTip>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Để bật tính năng in hóa đơn vận chuyển trong chứng từ &quot;Giao hàng và cung cấp dịch vụ&quot; và &quot;Điều chuyển hàng hóa nội bộ&quot;.</value>
  </toolTip>
  <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
  <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
  <choiceHistoryOnInput>DontUse</choiceHistoryOnInput>
  <dataLockControlMode>Managed</dataLockControlMode>
</mdclass:Constant>
